    "created_at": "2020-05-13T00:14:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-13T00:14:41Z",
    "body": "It was pointed out by @classilla that Firefox re-added support for `gopher` to its Extensions API about 3 years ago. This is used in the OverbiteWX extension to handle `gopher:` URLs using a web-to-Gopher proxy (Floodgap).\r\n\r\n- https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/manifest.json/protocol_handlers\r\n- https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1385357\r\n- https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/overbitewx/\r\n- https://gopher.floodgap.com/gopher/",
